<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h1 class="display-4 fw-bold mb-3">Attendance Management & Alerts</h1>
        <p class="lead mb-4">
            Replace paper roll-call with high-integrity digital registers that bridge the 
            communication gap between school and home in real-time.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Daily & Subject-Level Registers</h2>
        <p>
            Digitize the heartbeat of your school through mobile-responsive attendance 
            registers. Teachers can mark daily presence or subject-specific roll-call 
            from any device, ensuring that student presence is recorded accurately 
            within seconds. The system handles late arrivals, early departures, and 
            approved leave applications, providing a complete and authoritative 
            time-log for every student throughout the academic term.
        </p>
        <p>
            Attendance percentages are computed automatically, allowing for immediate 
            validation against the school's minimum attendance requirements (e.g., 
            must attend ≥80% to receive a final report card).
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Automated High-Priority Alerts</h2>
        <p>
            Enhance student safety through automated parent notifications. Frame 
            automatically identifies absent students and triggers personalized 
            WhatsApp, SMS, or email alerts to registered parents within minutes 
             of the morning roll-call. This real-time loop ensures that parents are 
            immediately aware if their child has failed to arrive at school, 
            providing critical security for the student and peace-of-mind for the 
            family.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Chronic Absenteeism & Analytics</h2>
        <p>
            Identify and support at-risk students before attendance issues impact academic 
            results. The Attendance module highlights patterns of chronic 
            absenteeism or recurrent lateness, providing pastoral and academic 
            leadership with the data needed for early intervention. Trend reports 
            can be aggregated by form, subject, or student house, highlighting 
            departmental attendance anomalies and informing school-wide welfare 
            strategies.
        </p>
        <p>
            Historical attendance records are archived permanently, providing an 
            essential data-layer for student references and overall school 
            performance audits.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

